# What `docker build` may send from the repo root to the Docker daemon, which is the
# AWS dev server (ADR-0007), so this is also what leaves the laptop.
# An ALLOWLIST: ignore everything, then admit only what images need. Secrets (.env,
# tfvars, tfstate) can't be sent by accident when nothing is sent by default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!services/
!migrations/
!policy/
!scripts/ops/

# ...and within those, nothing generated or test-only.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/tests
**/.pytest_cache
